      "translation": {
        "english_text": "I have become a sinner who cannot see the child's face! Muthu... what do you look like? Are you fair like your father? Looking at my disguise, do I seem like a beggar to you? I am not a beggar! A zamindar's wife! Your father is the zamindar!",
        "mode": "prose-faithful",
        "notes": []
      }
    },
