          }
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "english_text": "Meenu...... I never sought that needless crown! I wanted to make all property common property. But...... that desire fell into the fire and its life turned to ash.",
        "mode": "prose-faithful",
        "notes": []
      }
    },
